  "behavior": [
    "The same walking character transfers between ships in one running duel.",
    "The transfer preserves round IDs, positions, velocities, combat clock, pause, speed and both ships' health.",
    "Each ship restores its own visitor position and look independently. Tab and the exterior button return to the previous live bridge.",
    "The visitor can walk on Glacier's floor while the duel is paused. The occupied bridge has the only active deck collision.",
    "The opponent projects through Glacier's forward pane, with a clear sightline over Glacier's hull.",
    "Incoming damage to Glacier lights its sill. The same hit assigned to Delta alone leaves Glacier's sill idle.",
    "After a real round destroys the occupied ship in a disposable client, the exterior opens and the survivor remains visitable."
